logViewer.filterSets.markdownDescription:
Named groups of filter rules. Toggle entire sets on/off from the toolbar to switch between analysis scenarios (e.g. "Login", "Audio"). Edit interactively via the *Edit Filter Sets* command or the toolbar button.

```json
[
  {
    "name": "Login",
    "enabled": true,
    "filters": [
      { "name": "Auth Error", "pattern": "auth.*fail", "regex": true, "color": "#5a1f1f" }
    ]
  }
]
```
